        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Harrison, Dorree Cooper\n- Works: Legends of the Fall, Legends of the Fall novella\n- Topics: film adaptation, Academy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Jim Harrison was an American writer who lived from December 11, 1937 to March 26, 2016.\n- Jim Harrison was known for poetry, fiction, reviews, essays about the outdoors, and writings about food.\n- Jim Harrison wrote the 1979 novella Legends of the Fall.\n- The film Legends of the Fall was based on the 1979 novella of the same title by Jim Harrison.\n- The film Legends of the Fall is about three brothers and their father living in the wilderness and plains of Montana in the early 20th century.\n- The film Legends of the Fall shows how the family’s lives are affected by nature, history, war, and love.\n- Dorree Cooper was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Art Direction for the film Legends of the Fall.",
